# ==============================================================================
# 20-web.list: Web Application Security & HTTP Assessment
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
#  - To DISABLE a tool: prefix with '#' (e.g., # ffuf)
#  - To REMOVE a tool:  delete the line
#  - To ADD a tool:     add the Fedora package name on a new line
#
# Related lists:
#  - Python web tools (sqlmap, mitmproxy, arjun, dirsearch): see pipx-lists/pipx-tools.list
#  - Enterprise proxies (burpsuite, zap): see upstreams/
# ==============================================================================

# --- Content Discovery & Web Fuzzing ---
ffuf                        # Fast web fuzzer written in Go (directory & parameter fuzzing)
gobuster                    # URI and DNS brute-forcing tool written in Go

# --- Fingerprinting & HTTP Clients ---
whatweb                     # Web scanner identifying CMS, blogging platforms, JavaScript libraries
httpie                      # User-friendly command-line HTTP client with formatted JSON output

# --- Browsers ---
chromium                    # Open-source browser for client-side payload & XSS validation
